      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Welcome to this humble place of prayer.\r\nIf you don't mind, I would like\r\nto hear your story.",
        "Jp" : "ようこそ、小さき祈りの場へ\r\n私でよければお話を伺いましょう"
