      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The White Dragon enshrined in the temple, And the\r\nancient, revered entity of legend— The evil god\r\nsaid to dwell in the abyss between worlds.",
        "Jp" : "神殿におわす白竜様、さらに伝承にある古き\r\n尊き存在、異界の底に在るという邪神"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 212527,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What kind of being we look up to is different for\r\neach of us, but it is the same for us to borrow\r\nits power and share its benefits with\r\nourselves and with others.",
        "Jp" : "どういった存在を仰ぐかは人により異なれど\r\nその御力を借り、己、そして他者へ\r\nその恩恵を分け与えるは同じです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 212528,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you heal wounds, purify impurities, save and\r\nshow compassion to people, and if you have the\r\nawareness of being a guide to a  good destiny,\r\nThe path as a Priest is always open.",
        "Jp" : "傷を癒し、不浄を除き、人々を救い慈しむ\r\nそして善き運命への導き手たる自覚をもつならば\r\nプリーストとしての道はいつでも開けています"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 212529,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 0
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2107,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Camus",
      "Jp" : "カミュ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
