      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 25,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "—The presence you wear, and the\r\nlook in your eyes...\r\nNow, you may have touched more lives\r\nand deaths than I have!",
        "Jp" : "――貴方が纏う気配、そして眼差し\r\n今や貴方は私以上に多くの生死に\r\n触れてきたのかもしれません"
